// 进销存 · 销售管理功能域：销货单（主子表）查询/暂存/提交/删除/复制/整单退货 + 接口 + 页面
// 与采购同构（客户方向）；销售单价取商品 salePrice

@export
function searchSalesBills(billNo: String, status: DocStatus): List<SalesBill> {
  return SalesBill.where(billNo like '%' + billNo.trim() + '%', status = status);
}

@export
function saveSalesBill(input: SalesBillInput): SalesBill {
  const existing = input.id !== null && input.id > 0;
  const bill = new SalesBill();
  if (existing) {
    const bill = SalesBill.get(input.id);
  }
  bill.billNo = input.billNo;
  bill.billDate = input.billDate;
  bill.customerId = input.customerId;
  bill.contractNo = input.contractNo;
  bill.invoiceNo = input.invoiceNo;
  bill.logisticsCompany = input.logisticsCompany;
  bill.logisticsNo = input.logisticsNo;
  bill.settleMode = input.settleMode;
  bill.remark = input.remark;
  bill.status = DocStatus.DRAFT;
  bill.totalAmount = 0;
  bill.save();
  if (input.items.count > 0) {
    for (const ol of SalesBillItem.where(billId = bill.id)) {
      ol.delete();
    }
    bill.totalAmount = 0;
    for (const it of input.items) {
      const g = Goods.get(it.goodsId);
      const item = new SalesBillItem();
      item.billId = bill.id;
      item.goodsId = it.goodsId;
      item.goodsCode = g.code;
      item.goodsName = g.name;
      item.category = g.category;
      item.spec = g.spec;
      item.unit = g.unit;
      item.qty = it.qty;
      item.price = it.price;
      item.amount = it.qty * it.price;
      item.save();
      bill.totalAmount = bill.totalAmount + it.qty * it.price;
    }
    bill.save();
  }
  return bill;
}

@export
function submitSalesBill(id: Integer): Boolean {
  const bill = SalesBill.get(id);
  if (bill.status !== DocStatus.DRAFT) {
    return false;
  }
  bill.status = DocStatus.SUBMITTED;
  bill.save();
  const rec = new Receivable();
  rec.billNo = bill.billNo;
  rec.customerId = bill.customerId;
  rec.amount = bill.totalAmount;
  rec.paidAmount = 0;
  rec.status = PayStatus.WAIT_CONFIRM;
  rec.remark = '';
  rec.save();
  return true;
}

@export
function deleteSalesBill(id: Integer): Boolean {
  const bill = SalesBill.get(id);
  if (bill.status !== DocStatus.DRAFT) {
    return false;
  }
  for (const it of SalesBillItem.where(billId = id)) {
    it.delete();
  }
  bill.delete();
  return true;
}

@export
function copySalesBill(id: Integer): SalesBill {
  const src = SalesBill.get(id);
  const bill = new SalesBill();
  bill.billNo = 'COPY-' + src.billNo;
  bill.status = DocStatus.DRAFT;
  bill.billDate = src.billDate;
  bill.customerId = src.customerId;
  bill.contractNo = src.contractNo;
  bill.invoiceNo = src.invoiceNo;
  bill.logisticsCompany = src.logisticsCompany;
  bill.logisticsNo = src.logisticsNo;
  bill.settleMode = src.settleMode;
  bill.remark = src.remark;
  bill.totalAmount = src.totalAmount;
  bill.save();
  for (const si of SalesBillItem.where(billId = id)) {
    const item = new SalesBillItem();
    item.billId = bill.id;
    item.goodsId = si.goodsId;
    item.goodsCode = si.goodsCode;
    item.goodsName = si.goodsName;
    item.category = si.category;
    item.spec = si.spec;
    item.unit = si.unit;
    item.qty = si.qty;
    item.price = si.price;
    item.amount = si.amount;
    item.remark = si.remark;
    item.save();
  }
  return bill;
}

@export
function returnSalesBill(id: Integer): SalesReturnBill {
  const src = SalesBill.get(id);
  const ret = new SalesReturnBill();
  ret.billNo = 'RT-' + src.billNo;
  ret.status = DocStatus.DRAFT;
  ret.returnDate = src.billDate;
  ret.sourceBillNo = src.billNo;
  ret.totalAmount = src.totalAmount;
  ret.remark = src.remark;
  ret.save();
  for (const si of SalesBillItem.where(billId = id)) {
    const item = new SalesReturnItem();
    item.billId = ret.id;
    item.goodsId = si.goodsId;
    item.goodsCode = si.goodsCode;
    item.goodsName = si.goodsName;
    item.qty = si.qty;
    item.price = si.price;
    item.amount = si.amount;
    item.save();
  }
  return ret;
}

@export
function searchSalesReturns(billNo: String): List<SalesReturnBill> {
  return SalesReturnBill.where(billNo like '%' + billNo.trim() + '%');
}

// @title('销货退货列表') 已生成
@title('销货退货列表')
@menu('销售管理')
page SalesReturnList {
  <input field="billNo" label="退货单号" />
  <table dataSource={useQuery('searchSalesReturns')}>
    <column field="billNo" title="退货单号" />
    <column field="returnDate" title="退货日期" />
    <column field="sourceBillNo" title="原销货单号" />
    <column field="totalAmount" title="总金额" />
    <column field="status" title="单证状态" />
  </table>
}

interface SalesApi {
  GET    '/api/sales-bills'              -> searchSalesBills
  POST   '/api/sales-bills'              -> saveSalesBill
  POST   '/api/sales-bills/submit'       -> submitSalesBill
  DELETE '/api/sales-bills/{id}'         -> deleteSalesBill
  POST   '/api/sales-bills/copy'         -> copySalesBill
  POST   '/api/sales-bills/return'       -> returnSalesBill
  GET    '/api/sales-returns'            -> searchSalesReturns
}

// ---- 页面 ----

// @title('销货单列表') 已生成
@title('销货单列表')
@menu('销售管理')
page SalesBillList {
  <input field="billNo" label="销货单号" />
  <input field="status" label="单证状态" />
  <table dataSource={useQuery('searchSalesBills')}>
    <column field="billNo" title="销货单号" />
    <column field="billDate" title="销货日期" />
    <column field="customerId" title="客户" />
    <column field="status" title="单证状态" />
    <column field="totalAmount" title="总金额" />
    <column field="settleMode" title="结算方式" />
    <button text="编辑" action={openDialog('SalesBillEdit', row)} />
    <button text="删除" action={useMutation('deleteSalesBill', row.id)} />
    <button text="复制" fold="true" action={useMutation('copySalesBill', row.id)} />
    <button text="整单退货" fold="true" action={useMutation('returnSalesBill', row.id)} />
  </table>
  <button text="新增销货单" action={openDialog('SalesBillEdit')} />
}

@title('销货单编辑')
@menu('销售管理')
dialog SalesBillEdit {
  <form submit={useMutation('saveSalesBill')}>
    <input field="billNo" label="销货单号" />
    <input field="billDate" label="销货日期" />
    <input field="customerId" label="客户" />
    <input field="contractNo" label="合同号" />
    <input field="invoiceNo" label="发票号" />
    <input field="logisticsCompany" label="物流公司" />
    <input field="logisticsNo" label="物流单号" />
    <input field="settleMode" label="结算方式" />
    <input field="remark" label="备注" />
    <repeat field="items">
      <input field="goodsId" label="商品" />
      <input field="qty" label="数量" />
      <input field="price" label="单价" />
    </repeat>
    <button text="暂存" />
  </form>
  <button text="提交" action={useMutation('submitSalesBill')} />
}
